               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "As stated, I think this is about all we need to do. We could support dbus, but so far I see no need, and we can open a new bug reprot to track that if desired.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "BUt as of v2.0a211, we now have shipped a sample .service file with the sample service,a and an installer that autoinstalls and starts etc the service.",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
